!An experimental and kinetic modeling study on 4-methylheptane pyrolysis at atmospheric pressure
!Haikun Lang a, Fangping Bin a, Shuyao Chen b, Xiaoli Zhang a, Jiuzheng Yin a, Jinzeng Pan a, Zhandong Wang b,*, Lixia Wei a,*
!
!The mechanism was updated based on the 3-methylheptane model of Wang et al [1], aromatic mechanisms were from the toluene model of Yuan et al [2]. 
!REFERENCES:
![1] W.J. Wang, Z.H. Li, M.A. Oehlschlaeger, D. Healy, H.J. Curran, S.M. Sarathy, et al. An experimental and modeling study of the autoignition of 3-methylheptane.
!    Proceedings of the Combustion Institute 2013;34:335-43. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.proci.2012.06.001.    
![2] W.H. Yuan, Y.Y. Li, P. Dagaut, J.Z. Yang, F. Qi. Investigation on the pyrolysis and oxidation of toluene over a wide range conditions.
!	 I. Flow reactor pyrolysis and jet stirred reactor oxidation. Combustion and Flame 2015;162:3-21. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.combustflame.2014.07.009.
